# Agent instructions and tooling: tracked on the private `master` branch only
# (added there with `git add -f`), absent from `main`. The marketplace installs
# a clone of main into the plugin directory, where a coding agent would read a
# root AGENTS.md as its own instructions; the review blocked the listing on it.
# Listed here so a checkout of main never offers them, and so a merge from
# master cannot bring them back unnoticed.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.mcp.json
.ignore
# Per-machine Claude Code permissions: never tracked, on any branch.
